      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.template.spec.providerSpec.value.cloudsSecret.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the secret name for the cluster. Do not change this value.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.template.spec.providerSpec.value.flavor</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the RHOSP flavor type for the control plane.</p></dd>
